                    AwakeningSection(heading: "Building on the Foundation", body: "Module 9 gave you four evidence-based meditation protocols. This lesson adds quantum-informed parameters for engineers and scientists who want the next layer.\n\nAll protocols below build on the foundation. Don't skip to these — complete the 8-week basic program first.\n\nPROTOCOL A: Quantum Active Imagination (10-15 min)\n1. PREPARE STATE: Relax. Note your current dominant mental mode (Thinking? Feeling? Planning? Worrying?). This is your current state vector.\n2. INTRODUCE SUPERPOSITION: Allow the complementary shadow image to arise WITHOUT collapsing it. If you're in Thinking mode, let Feeling show up. If you're in Control mode, let Surrender show up. Hold both.\n3. APPLY UNITARY ROTATION: Dialogue with the shadow state. \"What do you need?\" This is a controlled rotation in Hilbert space — not eliminating either state but finding the angle that integrates both.\n4. MEASURE: Record the outcome. Test the integrated insight in a real decision this week.\n\nMetric: Pre/post coherence score (1-10). How unified do you feel before vs. after?\n\nPROTOCOL B: Non-Markovian Memory Sweep (15 min)\nTarget: Ancestral and inherited patterns that persist across time.\n1. Body scan with temporal awareness — notice sensations and ask \"When did this pattern start?\"\n2. Follow the sensation backward. Your body stores temporal markers.\n3. Apply Lindblad-like decoherence: observe the old pattern without re-triggering. Neutral labeling only.\n4. Track intensity reduction across sessions.\n\nMetric: Trigger intensity score session over session. Should decrease non-linearly.\n\nPROTOCOL C: Entanglement Resolution (LKM + Tensor View)\nFor relationship patterns — interpersonal feedback loops.\n1. Visualize yourself and the other person as entangled qubits.\n2. Notice where your states are correlated — their anger triggers your shutdown, your criticism triggers their withdrawal.\n3. Apply controlled-NOT mentally: \"May you be safe.\" This flips the complementary state. Instead of reactivity → compassion. Instead of judgment → curiosity.\n4. Track relationship friction incidents.\n\nMetric: Weekly friction count + subjective connection score.\n\nPROTOCOL D: Hyper-Precision Meditation (20 min, Advanced)\n1. Open monitoring with explicit attention to prediction-error STRENGTH.\n2. Notice which thoughts have high precision (feel very \"true\" and urgent) vs. low precision (passing, light).\n3. Practice down-weighting high-precision shadow priors. That VERY URGENT feeling that \"something is wrong\"? Notice its precision. Ask: is this current data or old firmware?\n4. This directly implements Laukkonen's hyper-precision model.\n\nMetric: HRV (heart rate variability) if you have a tracker. Or simple breath-hold tolerance as a proxy for autonomic coherence. Both increase with practice."),
                    AwakeningSection(heading: "The Full Stack", body: "Let's zoom out and see what we've built across the science track:\n\nMODULE 7: Shadow Integration — What the shadow is, 5 feedback loops, 6-step protocol\nMODULE 8: Shadow for Engineers — Code metaphors, debugging workflow, 30-day sprint\nMODULE 9: Neuroscience of Awakening — DMN/SN/CEN, meditation = recalibration, dark night in the brain\nMODULE 10: Jung Through Brain Science — Every concept mapped to fMRI studies with citations\nMODULE 11: Quantum Cognition — Predictive coding, quantum probability, advanced firmware protocols\n\nFive modules. Zero mysticism. Every claim backed by peer-reviewed studies. Every protocol testable and measurable.\n\nBut here's the thing I need to say:\n\nThe science track and the spiritual track describe the same reality.\n\nRumi and Friston. St. John of the Cross and Willoughby Britton. The Upanishads and Panksepp. Jung and fMRI. They're all pointing at the same process.\n\nEgo dissolves → DMN downregulates.\nDark Night → catastrophic prediction error cascade.\nUnity Consciousness → triple network integration.\nKarma → feedback loops with non-Markovian memory.\nEnlightenment → optimal coherent state with minimal prediction error.\n\nYou don't have to choose between science and spirit. They're the same signal measured by different instruments.\n\nOne uses equations. The other uses poetry.\nBoth are accurate.\nNeither is complete alone.\n\nThat's the real lesson of this entire course. Not that one tradition has the answer. Not that one methodology is supreme. But that reality is multi-layered — and the more measurement systems you use, the clearer the picture becomes.\n\nScience and the universe work together.\nThe math is lit.\nAnd so are you. 🔥"),
